        "Description": "The HR department of the vinyard  Viñedo Yates in Mendoza Chile has hired the ICA to eliminate 3 employees that Chile&apos;s &quot;fair employment&quot; laws are protecting from termination.\r\rFresco Irañez, who patrols the vinyard, made an insensitive comment about one HR employee&apos;s Grandmother.\r\rKate Gilmore, the event planner, harasses employees under her verbally while doing nothing more than pacing and making phone calls.\r\rFinally, the last target has gained a nickname &quot;The Eternal Pisser.&quot;\r\rGood luck 47.",
